# Phaicull Codebase Map

Offline-first photo-culling CLI. Python 3.12+, uv, Typer + rich, loguru, Pydantic v2, SQLite (WAL). Run: `uv run phaicull scan <folder>`; tests: `uv run pytest` (~120 tests).

## Architecture (Brain/Brawn)
- `core/cli.py` — Typer entry point (`phaicull scan <folder> [--config]`).
- `core/config.py` — Pydantic `Config` loaded from TOML (`phaicull.toml.example`): thresholds, loader limits, scanner.max_workers, burst window.
- `core/scanner/` — `walker.py` (discovery → `DiscoveryResult(valid, rejected_mime)`; gates: skip own phaicull/ dir, path-safety, MIME), `pipeline.py` (Brain: asyncio orchestration, batch DB commits of 50; writes `skipped_invalid_mime` status rows for MIME rejects), `worker.py` (Brawn: per-file `process_file` in ProcessPoolExecutor — hash, decode once, run all analyzers on the array, count analyzer_errors; never raises).
- `core/loader/image_loader.py` — safe decode (size/dimension checks → Pillow → EXIF orient → BGR ndarray). Formats: JPEG/PNG/HEIC/GIF/WebP (DEC-008).
- `core/analyzers/` — `BaseAnalyzer` contract v2 (DEC-007): one metric each, input decoded BGR `np.ndarray` + `Path` for context, output `AnalyzerResult|None`; must not re-decode or mutate the array. `get_sprint1_analyzers()` returns Blur/Exposure/Duplicates.
- `core/database/` — `dao.py` (all SQL lives here), `migrate.py` (custom sequential .sql runner + `schema_version` table), `schema.py` (name constants).
- `core/utils/` — `mime.py` (magic bytes: JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP/HEIC), `exif.py` (auto-orient), `path_safety.py` (scope validation).

## Data
- Project DB: `{scanned_folder}/phaicull/phaicull.db` — tables `files`, `metrics` (key-value: metric_name/value_real/value_text), `groups`. Migrations at 003.
- Registry DB: `.projects/registry.db` — table `projects`.
- Contracts (stable APIs) documented in `docs/`: `json_contract_scan_v1.md`, `progress_contract.md`, `features_schema_v1.md`, `decisions.md` (DEC-001..), `adr-001.md`.

## Current status (Sprint 1, mid-way)
- DONE: Sprint 0 foundation; Sprint 1 infra — DB schema/migrations/DAO, loader, MIME/EXIF/path-safety utils, Brain/Brawn pipeline, CLI scan skeleton, all contracts documented. Tech-debt sweep 2026-07-03 (see TODO.md Bugs section): error counting, MIME-reject status rows, group_id-preserving upsert, analyzer contract v2, cpu_count workers, ruff+mypy(strict)+CI.
- NOT DONE: the three analyzers are STUBS raising `NotImplementedError` (`core/analyzers/{blur,exposure,duplicates}.py`) — scans persist files but zero metrics. Also missing: normalization utils, grouping, thumbnailer, `--json` output, progress events, SIGINT handling.
- Test fixtures are synthetic (generated in `tests/conftest.py`); `.local-photos/` is gitignored for real photos, `benchmark/{blurry,sharp}/` expected there.
- Tooling: `uv run ruff check core tests`, `uv run mypy` (strict, core only), CI in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.

## Conventions
- Source of truth for tasks: `TODO.md`. Workflow rules: `AGENTS.md` (atomic tasks, 4-category analyzer tests, DAO-only SQL, Path objects across processes, no network ever).
- Git: small commits — one TODO item or one issue per commit; never batch unrelated changes.
